782 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 175 0 R
/E (The Fogstar Energy 32kWh battery comes with a 6-year warranty and 10-year customer support, covering BMS failure, cell failure, temperature sensors, charging/discharging faults, and internal corrosion. Excludes misuse, tampering, incompatible systems, or accidental damage.)
/Pg 41 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
783 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 175 0 R
/E (Reporting an Issue)
