784 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 175 0 R
/E (If you experience a problem with your Fogstar unit, please contact our Customer Services team first so we can help resolve it quickly and efficiently. Please send any images or screenshots, along with a description of the issue, to: customerservice@fogstar.co.uk. )
/Pg 41 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
785 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 175 0 R
/T (Does the system include fire suppression?)
/E (Does the system include fire suppression?)
/Pg 41 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
786 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 175 0 R
/E (The battery includes an integrated, automatic aerosol fire suppression system. If internal temperatures reach the activation threshold, the unit releases a potassium-based aerosol that interrupts the combustion process and suppresses fire without manual intervention.)
/Pg 41 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
787 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 175 0 R
/E (Do I need to configure DIP switches?)
/Pg 41 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
788 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 175 0 R
/E (The Fogstar Energy 32kWh utilises a BMS with automatic address allocation. No DIP switch configuration is required.)
/Pg 41 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
789 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 175 0 R
/E (Does the battery need to be powered off before connecting?)
/Pg 41 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
790 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 175 0 R
/E (Yes. All batteries must remain in the shutdown state before connecting communication or power cables.)
/Pg 41 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
791 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 175 0 R
/E (Can these batteries work with other inverter brands?)
/Pg 41 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
792 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 175 0 R
/E (Yes. The BMS seamlessly integrates with a wide range of popular inverters, containing pre-loaded protocols for popular LV inverter brands including but not limited to LuxPower, Sunsynk, Solis, Victron and more.)
/Pg 41 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
793 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 175 0 R
/E (Can I mix different battery capacities or models in the same system?)
/Pg 41 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
794 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 175 0 R
/E (No. Only identical battery models with the same capacity and BMS configuration should be connected in parallel.)
/Pg 41 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
